  "title": {
   "en": "I Became the Mother of the Sub-Male Lead’s Son"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "서브남주 아들의 엄마가 되었습니다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Reincarnated as Elia, the daughter of a ruined noble, the protagonist struggles to escape debt collectors. One day, she saves a child from an attack, only to be mistaken for a kidnapper and taken to Duke Kaiden’s mansion. To avoid punishment, she becomes the child’s nanny. Now, she must clear the misunderstanding and find a way to survive in her new life."
  },
